{"ticker":"2006","company":"TUNG HO STEEL ENTERPRISE COR COMMON STOCK TWD10.0","description":"Tung Ho Steel Enterprise Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, produces and sells steel products in Taiwan. It offers re-bars, such as round bar, screwed re-bar, Compact rebar, Tensile, and deformed steel re-bar products for building projects; and formed steel products, including H-beams, I-beams, channel beams, and U-beams; plate-type steel products. The company also provides processing services, such as rebar cutting, bending, processing, forming, friction welding, welded steel mesh, and built-up H-beam. The company was founded in 1946 and is headquartered in Taipei, Taiwan.","prices":[["2024-07-01",63.345],["2024-07-02",63.2556],["2024-07-03",63.7917],["2024-07-04",63.613],["2024-07-05",64.3278],["2024-07-08",63.7917],["2024-07-09",62.7196],["2024-07-10",62.2729],["2024-07-11",62.8983],["2024-07-12",63.345],["2024-07-15",63.8811],["2024-07-16",63.4343],["2024-07-17",63.1663],["2024-07-18",64.2384],["2024-07-19",65.1319],["2024-07-22",65.8466],["2024-07-23",65.1319],["2024-07-26",64.8638],["2024-07-29",65.936],["2024-07-30",66.472],["2024-07-31",65.8466],["2024-08-01",67.0081],["2024-08-02",66.7401],["2024-08-05",63.613],["2024-08-06",65.2212],["2024-08-07",67.9015],["2024-08-08",68.3483],["2024-08-09",67.8122],["2024-08-12",68.4376],["2024-08-13",69.1524],["2024-08-14",70.2245],["2024-08-15",69.2417],["2024-08-16",68.2589],["2024-08-19",68.1696],["2024-08-20",69.063],["2024-08-21",69.2417],["2024-08-22",68.8843],["2024-08-23",69.6884],["2024-08-26",69.4204],["2024-08-27",70.3138],["2024-08-28",70.4032],["2024-08-29",70.3138],["2024-08-30",69.8671],["2024-09-02",70.6712],["2024-09-03",70.7605],["2024-09-04",69.5991],["2024-09-05",70.5819],["2024-09-06",70.4032],["2024-09-09",69.6884],["2024-09-10",68.6163],["2024-09-11",67.4548],["2024-09-12",68.8843],["2024-09-13",68.6163],["2024-09-16",69.1524],["2024-09-18",67.9909],["2024-09-19",68.5269],["2024-09-20",68.6163],